{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root sampling confirmed audience leakage in the client front door. README.md combines onboarding with lock implementation, CI rationale, dependency design, gate internals, development tooling, and repeated install guidance. docs/user-guide.md includes top-level router mechanics and a dated credential incident. Current rebar help omits the intercepted explain, review-plan, review-code, verify-completion, scan-spec, and workflow commands even though the generated CLI reference lists them. Open RP-05 tickets already plan the registry cutover, so the audit will record coordination and post-cutover verification instead of duplicating that implementation. No project files changed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787287798158239001,"uuid":"cc6973bc-9d7d-4d56-934c-bf7c1a215a4c"}